        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Key Out a Green Screen\n\nRemoves a green screen background from video footage. Use it to prepare a clip for compositing over a new background.\n\n**How it works:** The \"Footage\" input feeds \"Key\", which makes pixels near the key color #00FF00 transparent. Similarity sets how wide a color range is removed, and blend softens the edge. \"Result\" shows the keyed clip.\n\n**Try this:** If green fringes remain around the subject, raise similarity on \"Key\" from 0.3 to 0.4. If the subject starts to disappear, lower it again."
        },
